# HYDRA TERMINAL — PRODUCTION ENVIRONMENT SETUP

### REQUIRED SECRETS
The following environment variables MUST be set in a `.env` file in the `backend/` directory. 
The system will fail to start if any are missing.

```bash
# Security
API_KEY=                # Institutional API Key for Frontend ↔ Backend auth
FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Intelligence
GOOGLE_API_KEY=         # Gemini-2.0-Flash API Key
```

### FRONTEND CONFIGURATION
The frontend requires the same `API_KEY` to be passed as an environment variable during build/runtime.

```bash
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_KEY=    # Must match backend API_KEY
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=    # http://localhost:8000
```
